["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.32",30,267,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.29",26,268,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.26",22,269,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.23",19,270,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.20",16,271,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.17",13,272,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.14",10,273,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.11",7,274,"instance"],["lambda","inst._@.Mathlib.Order.Basic.1059403224._hygCtx._hyg.8",4,275,"instance"],["lambda","β",1,276,"implicit"],["lambda","α",0,277,"implicit"]],"project":false,"range":{"column":0,"endColumn":16,"endLine":832,"line":814},"type":179,"typeText":"{α : Type u_2} →\n  {β : Type u_3} →\n    [inst : LinearOrder.{u_3} β] →\n      [inst_1 : LE.{u_2} α] →\n        [inst_2 : LT.{u_2} α] →\n          [inst_3 : Max.{u_2} α] →\n            [inst_4 : Min.{u_2} α] →\n              [inst_5 : Ord.{u_2} α] →\n                [DecidableEq.{u_2 + 1} α] →\n                  [DecidableLE.{u_2} α] →\n                    [DecidableLT.{u_2} α] →\n                      (f : α → β) →\n                        Function.Injective.{u_2 + 1, u_3 + 1} f →\n                          (∀ {x y : α}, Iff (LE.le.{u_3} (f x) (f y)) (LE.le.{u_2} x y)) →\n                            (∀ {x y : α}, Iff (LT.lt.{u_3} (f x) (f y)) (LT.lt.{u_2} x y)) →\n                              (∀ (x y : α), Eq.{u_3 + 1} (f (x ⊓ y)) (Min.min.{u_3} (f x) (f y))) →\n                                (∀ (x y : α), Eq.{u_3 + 1} (f (x ⊔ y)) (Max.max.{u_3} (f x) (f y))) →\n                                  (∀ (x y : α), Eq.{1} (Ord.compare.{u_3} (f x) (f y)) (Ord.compare.{u_2} x y)) →\n                                    LinearOrder.{u_2} α","unsafe":false,"value":278,"source":{"code":"/-- Pull back a `LinearOrder` instance along an injective function.\n\nSee note [reducible non-instances]. -/\nabbrev Function.Injective.linearOrder [LinearOrder β] [LE α] [LT α] [Max α] [Min α] [Ord α]\n    [DecidableEq α] [DecidableLE α] [DecidableLT α] (f : α → β)\n    (hf : Function.Injective f) (le : ∀ {x y}, f x ≤ f y ↔ x ≤ y) (lt : ∀ {x y}, f x < f y ↔ x < y)\n    (min : ∀ x y, f (x ⊓ y) = f x ⊓ f y) (max : ∀ x y, f (x ⊔ y) = f x ⊔ f y)\n    (compare : ∀ x y, compare (f x) (f y) = compare x y) :\n    LinearOrder α where\n  toPartialOrder := hf.partialOrder _ le lt\n  toDecidableLE := ‹_›\n  toDecidableEq := ‹_›\n  toDecidableLT := ‹_›\n  le_total _ _ := by simp only [← le, le_total]\n  min_def _ _ := by simp_rw [← hf.eq_iff, ← le, apply_ite f, ← min_def, min]\n  max_def _ _ := by simp_rw [← hf.eq_iff, ← le, apply_ite f, ← max_def, max]\n  compare_eq_compareOfLessAndEq _ _ := by\n    simp_rw [← compare, LinearOrder.compare_eq_compareOfLessAndEq, compareOfLessAndEq, ← lt,\n      hf.eq_iff]","start":814,"end":832},"axioms":["propext"]}